msgid "Chassis_R97_Object_140_hound_TLXXL"
msgstr "Object 140 Resistor"

msgid "R113M_WT"
msgstr "R-113 Resistor"

msgid "R97_Object_140_hound_TLXXL"
msgstr "Resistor"

msgid "R97_Object_140_hound_TLXXL_descr"
msgstr ""
"They say this tank channels raw plasma into every shell—supercharged, "
"unstoppable. Sounds good to me. I don’t need to know how it works, just "
"where to aim. With this kind of firepower, even von Krieger’s oversized toy "
"won’t last long. Blitzträger? Please. Big doesn’t mean invincible. This "
"isn’t just a tank—it’s a walking rebuttal to every overbuilt monstrosity he "
"ever dreamed up. It’s time to put that theory to the test—one shot at a "
"time. And luckily…we’ve got all the time in the world."

